        "$f(4)=2$。$f'(x)=\\frac{1}{2\\sqrt{x}}$，$f'(4)=\\frac{1}{4}$。$f''(x)=-\\frac{1}{4x^{3/2}}$，$f''(4)=-\\frac{1}{4\\cdot 8}=-\\frac{1}{32}$。",
